     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi friend,<div><br></div><div>資料的篩選可參考以下文章 [<span style=\"font-family:Arial,Tahoma,Helvetica,FreeSans,sans-serif\"><font size=\"2\">矩陣的條件式篩選] </font></span><a href=\"http://rwepa.blogspot.tw/2016/08/matrixselect.html\" style=\"font-size:13px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rwepa.blogspot.tw/2016/08/matrixselect.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237860783000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0kIN00_CMsm1qEkyUpmvlQ\">http://rwepa.blogspot.tw/2016/08/matrixselect.html</a></div><div>本題關鍵可用 which 與 減號(表示刪除)</div><div><br></div><div>R demo:</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-wGpEFeOKkuQ/WCRv1MvhxyI/AAAAAAAAK2o/6o0q9xoQifQ57-nBMko_laehe16VufYsgCLcB/s1600/selectdata.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-wGpEFeOKkuQ/WCRv1MvhxyI/AAAAAAAAK2o/6o0q9xoQifQ57-nBMko_laehe16VufYsgCLcB/s1600/selectdata.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237860783000&amp;usg=AOvVaw39CwXIPFtJbKnh9ZLBj-qu\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-wGpEFeOKkuQ/WCRv1MvhxyI/AAAAAAAAK2o/6o0q9xoQifQ57-nBMko_laehe16VufYsgCLcB/s400/selectdata.png\" border=\"0\" width=\"342\" height=\"400\"></a></p><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></span></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#008\">set</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seed</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">168</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">mydata </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">frame</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">47</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">56</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">                     x2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">paste0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;SD&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1011173</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1011182</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">                     x3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> replace</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">                     x4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> replace</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">                     x5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> replace</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">                     x6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> replace</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">mydata</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">mydata</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:#000\">ind </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">which</span></font><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mydata$x3 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&amp;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mydata$x4 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mydata$x5 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">ind</span></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">mydata</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ind</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span></div><div><span style=\"color:#000\">mydata</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ind</span></font><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span></div></font></div></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>干皓丞於 2016年11月10日星期四 UTC+8下午6時44分26秒寫道：</div></div>"
